Package: impact.telemetry
Title: A Function Telemetry Toolkit for IMPACT Initiatives
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iyed", "GHEDAMSI", , "iyed.ghedamsi@impact-initiatives.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("IMPACT Initiatives", role = "cph")
  )
Description: A toolkit for adding telemetry to R functions, intended for
  use within the IMPACT Initiatives ecosystem. Utilizes a wrapper
  function to log execution metadata to a file. The configuration and
  data schema are tailored for IMPACT's internal package monitoring
  requirements.
